@@ -15,6 +15,10 @@ The value schemas in `typed-om.ts` are **generated from the CSS Typed OM WebIDL*
 - Every property + which accept `<color>` (resolved transitively) + `appliesTo` + `concerns`: **`@webref/css`** (the machine-readable CSS definitions). `CssProperty` (815), `ColorProperty` (42), in `properties.ts`.
 - Runtime enumeration + cross-check: **`StylePropertyMapReadOnly.keys()`** (Typed OM 1).
 
+## Fonts — CSS Fonts 4
+- Generic families + the system stacks: <https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#generic-font-families> (`font.ts`, generated from `@webref/css`). `font-family` reifies to a generic `CSSStyleValue` — the ONE `--font-sans` token.
+- Embedded webfonts: **`@font-face`** (<https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#font-face-rule>), `src: url(data:…) format()` (§src-desc; RFC 2397 data: URI, RFC 8081 `font/*` MIME), `font-display` (§font-display-desc, `swap` default). A `FontFace` token embeds the face in `style.css` — self-contained, no CDN, CSP-clean; the system stack stays the fallback tail.
+
 ## Color model — CSS Color 4
 - OKLCh: <https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#ok-lab> (Ottosson, 2020).
 
